  "version": "0.1.0",
  "organization": "ScaleDockHQ",
  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Serve LLMs with Ray Serve LLM (LLMConfig, build_openai_app, serve CLI, rayproject/ray-llm) and run them on Kubernetes with KubeRay RayService. Covers install, config, tensor/pipeline/data parallelism, prefix- and KV-aware routing, prefill/decode, multi-LoRA, autoscaling, observability, upgrades, GCS fault tolerance and troubleshooting, plus LiteLLM and KEDA combos and templates. Verified against Ray 2.59.0 and KubeRay v1.7.1.",
